## 🧬 Malware Quick Facts

- **Aliases:** TRISIS, HatMan
- **Type:** ICS Attack Framework / SIS Manipulation Tool
- **First Seen:** June 2017 — Saudi Arabia petrochemical facility
- **Disclosed:** December 14, 2017 (Mandiant / Dragos)
- **Attribution:** TsNIIKhM, Russian Federation (TEMP.Veles / XENOTIME)
- **Target:** Schneider Electric Triconex Tricon safety controllers
- **Impact:** Potential physical destruction, loss of life, environmental damage

